WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
This is the CCTV cloud storage,

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.000
connecting the CCTV camera to AWS cloud.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.000
So, you are using a router and also the Raspberry Pi.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
So, it connects all your devices.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
There is your router, the Raspberry Pi,
a camera, and a switch.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
So, it connects multiple cameras to the switch.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Once it gets to the switch, it is pushed to the back end.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:51.000
The organization can manage
different cameras in the frontend.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:58.000
You can open the camera.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:05.900
And this is the frontend.
